i started as a priest, with a spellbook of fireball and
a spellbook of magic missile.  i doused both with holy
water and read them.  i then stumbled upon a spellbook of
polymorph in the next room.  i doused it with holy water
and hung out until i was level 3.  on level 2 i hit a shop
full of wands.  i polypiled them until i got a wand of wishing.
i dipped it into the holy water, and asked for ...

3 blessed scrolls of charging
blessed +3 gray dragon scale mail
blessed +3 speed boots

charged the wand

blessed +3 gauntlets of power
blessed +3 war hammer named Mjollnir

i then pulled a bounce-shot fireball to get the shopkeeper's
attention and kicked his butt.  on level 4, i poly'd a spellbook
into a spellbook of identify, and from there i was home free.

here is the score file.


