 1    2576460  Frodo-P ascended to demigod-hood.                    2059 [2059]
 2     291429  Norig-W died on dungeon level 10 [max 25].              - [163]
                Killed by an orange dragon.

i would have done much better, but as it was my first time in the endgame, 
i was not sure what to bring along.  i had 107 diamonds sitting in a 
corner on level 1.  BTW, the wizard is a wimp, he was easy.

